       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTERESTTABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRINCIPAL   PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
       01 RATE        PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.05.
       01 BALANCE     PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 YEAR-NO     PIC 9(2).
       01 BALANCE-ED  PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE PRINCIPAL TO BALANCE
           PERFORM VARYING YEAR-NO FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL YEAR-NO > 5
               COMPUTE BALANCE ROUNDED = BALANCE * (1 + RATE)
               MOVE BALANCE TO BALANCE-ED
               DISPLAY "YEAR " YEAR-NO ": " BALANCE-ED
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
